<title>UK: Deutsche sets warrants on German blue chips.</title>
<headline>Deutsche sets warrants on German blue chips.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>DB Capital Markets has set in total 13 million American-style call and put warrants, in 26 equal tranches, on various German blue chips, lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said.</p>
<p>There are four tranches on BMW, four tranches on Deutsche Bank AG, five tranches on Deutsche Telekom, three tranches on Karstadt AG, two tranches on Linde AG, two tranches on RWE AG and six tranches on Volkswagen AG.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p> PAYDATE	   14.MAY.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   FRANKFURT, DUSSELDORF</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
